    "title": "El Paso memorial for mass shooting victims gains national acclaim - NewsBreak",
    "text": "cbs4local.com\nwebsite\nEl Paso\nEl Paso memorial for mass shooting victims gains national acclaim\nBy Staff,\n5 hours agoEL PASO, Texas (KFOX14/CBS4) — A memorial in El Paso honoring the victims of the August 3 mass shooting has received national recognition. The August Third Memorial, located at Jim Crouch Park and designed by local artist Tino Ortega, has been named one of the top 100 public art pieces in the United States by the prestigious CODA Awards.",
